      "text": "[7:30AM]  #Ikeja\n#Alausa\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nTraffic is still very encouraging along Obafemi Awolowo Axis, Aromire, Allen towards and outward Toyin, Kudirat Abiola way (Oregun) and Adeniyi Jones except for the alternation delay.\n\nIt's a bit slow from Olowu inward Ikeja underneath the bridge.\n#FollowLASTMA",
